      "title": "",
      "description": "To exit, proceed to the south end of the platform and use Assembly Elevator 719, then use Assembly Elevator 718 to access Revolution Dr. To board, travel to the Revolution Dr entrance and use Assembly Elevator 718, then use Assembly Elevator 719 to access the platform.",
